---

<section id="nosotros" class="about-section">
    <div class="background-overlay-img"></div>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="about-grid">
            <div class="about-content">
                <div class="tag-wrapper reveal-up">
                    <span class="tag">NUESTRA FILOSOFÍA</span>
                </div>
                <h2 class="reveal-up delay-1">
                    Obsesionados con la <span>Excelencia</span> y el Detalle
                </h2>
                <div class="line reveal-up delay-2"></div>
                <p class="description reveal-up delay-3">
                    En lmdevstudio no solo construimos sitios web; forjamos
                    identidades digitales. Creemos en la simplicidad como la
                    máxima sofisticación y en que cada línea de código debe
                    tener un propósito claro: elevar tu marca.
                </p>
                <div class="values">
                    <div class="value-item reveal-up delay-4">
                        <span class="value-num">01</span>
                        <div class="value-text">
                            <h3>Minimalismo Funcional</h3>
                            <p>
                                Eliminamos lo innecesario para que lo esencial
                                brille con fuerza propia.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="value-item reveal-up delay-5">
                        <span class="value-num">02</span>
                        <div class="value-text">
                            <h3>Rendimiento Extremo</h3>
                            <p>
                                La velocidad no es negociable. Creamos
                                experiencias que cargan en un parpadeo.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="value-item reveal-up delay-5">
                        <span class="value-num">03</span>
                        <div class="value-text">
                            <h3>Enfoque en Resultados</h3>
                            <p>
                                Diseño que no solo es estético, sino que está
                                pensado para convertir y crecer.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .about-section {
        position: relative;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        background-color: #1a1a1a;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .background-overlay-img {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background-image: url("/studio.png");
        background-size: cover;
        background-position: center;
        background-attachment: fixed;
        opacity: 0.6; /* Slight fade nicely blended */
        z-index: 0;
    }

    .container {
        max-width: 1280px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 6rem 2rem;
        width: 100%;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1; /* Content above background */
    }

    .about-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
        gap: 8rem;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .tag-wrapper {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .tag {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        border-radius: 100px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
        font-weight: 300;
        line-height: 1.1;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        color: #fff;
    }

    h2 span {
        font-weight: 500;
        font-style: italic;
    }

    .line {
        width: 80px;
        height: 1px;
        background: #fff;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .description {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
        margin-bottom: 4rem;
        max-width: 600px;
    }

    .values {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 2rem;
    }

    .value-item {
        display: flex;
        gap: 2rem;
    }

    .value-num {
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        margin-top: 0.3rem;
    }

    .value-text h3 {
        font-size: 1.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        color: #fff;
    }

    .value-text p {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
        line-height: 1.6;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    /* Reveal Up Animation */
    .reveal-up {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(20px);
        transition:
            opacity 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94),
            transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
    }

    .reveal-up.delay-1 {
        transition-delay: 0.1s;
    }
    .reveal-up.delay-2 {
        transition-delay: 0.2s;
    }
    .reveal-up.delay-3 {
        transition-delay: 0.3s;
    }
    .reveal-up.delay-4 {
        transition-delay: 0.4s;
    }
    .reveal-up.delay-5 {
        transition-delay: 0.5s;
    }

    .reveal-up.active {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
        .about-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 2rem;
        }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .about-section {
            min-height: auto;
            padding: 6rem 0;
        }
        .background-overlay-img {
            background-attachment: scroll; /* Disable fixed background on mobile */
        }
        .reveal-up {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: none;
        }
    }
</style>
